{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Pull otter images from the registry                     {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pull      [options] [image...]{R}                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry pl [options] [image...]{R}                  {2}│{R}
